msgid "#### Key Parameter Descriptions"
msgstr "#### 关键参数说明"

msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" `max-model-len` and `max-num-seqs` need to be set according to the actual "
"usage scenario."
msgstr "下面仅描述该模型/场景特有的关键参数。`max-model-len` 和 `max-num-seqs` 需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

msgid "**Model-specific parameters:**"
msgstr "**模型特有参数：**"

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 1`: Runs a single DP rank. `--tensor-parallel-size` is 8 on Ascend950DT and 16 on Atlas 800 A3. This layout is recommended to balance memory capacity and compute efficiency for the w8a8 weights.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`: Must be enabled for the MoE architecture of GLM-5.3-Flash.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`: Enables Ascend quantization for the w8a8 quantized weights.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: Enables graph capture for the decode phase only, improving decode performance by reducing kernel launch overhead.\n"
"- `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\": 1, \"video\": 0}'`: For text-only deployment, --limit-mm-per-prompt can be omitted. For multimodal deployment, configure this parameter according to the actual request shape. For example, use --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":2,\"video\":0}' for two-image requests, and use --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}' for one-video requests.\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": \"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`: Enables Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) speculative decoding with the DeepSeek-style MTP draft head of GLM-5.3-Flash. `num_speculative_tokens` (3-5) controls how many tokens are speculated per step; `enforce_eager: true` is required because GLM-5.3-Flash does not support graph-mode speculative decoding."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 1`：运行单个 DP rank。`--tensor-parallel-size` 在 Ascend950DT 上为 8，在 Atlas 800 A3 上为 16。建议采用此布局以平衡 w8a8 权重的内存容量和计算效率。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`：对于 GLM-5.3-Flash 的 MoE 架构，必须启用此参数。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`：为 w8a8 量化权重启用 Ascend 量化。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：仅对解码阶段启用图捕获，通过减少内核启动开销来提升解码性能。\n"
"- `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\": 1, \"video\": 0}'`：对于纯文本部署，可以省略 --limit-mm-per-prompt。对于多模态部署，请根据实际请求形态配置此参数。例如，对于双图像请求，使用 --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":2,\"video\":0}'；对于单视频请求，使用 --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}'。\n"
"- `--speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3, \"method\": \"deepseek_mtp\", \"enforce_eager\": true}'`：启用基于 GLM-5.3-Flash 的 DeepSeek 风格 MTP 草稿头的多令牌预测（MTP）投机解码。`num_speculative_tokens`（3-5）控制每步推测的令牌数量；必须设置 `enforce_eager: true`，因为 GLM-5.3-Flash 不支持图模式投机解码。"

msgid "### 5.2 Multi-Node Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 多节点部署"

msgid "=== \"A2 series\""
msgstr "=== \"A2 系列\""

msgid ""
"- Quantized model `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` can be deployed on 2 Atlas 800 A2 "
"(64GB × 8) nodes with DP2 across the two nodes (one DP rank per node) and "
"TP8 inside each node."
msgstr ""
"- 量化模型 `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` 可以部署在 2 个 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）节点上，跨两个节点使用 "
"DP2（每个节点一个 DP rank），节点内使用 TP8。"

msgid "Run the following scripts on two nodes respectively."
msgstr "分别在两个节点上运行以下脚本。"

msgid "**node 0**"
msgstr "**节点 0**"

msgid "**node 1**"
msgstr "**节点 1**"

msgid "#### Key Parameter Descriptions"
msgstr "#### 关键参数说明"

msgid "**Multi-node network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**多节点网络和数据并行配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via `ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 2 --data-parallel-size-local 1`: Runs two DP ranks across the two nodes, one rank per node; each rank uses TP8 within its node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting DP rank offset of the current node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `1`.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12321`: RPC port for data parallel master communication. Must be the same across all nodes.\n"
"- `--headless`: Indicates a non-master node (used on node 1). Do not use on node 0."
msgstr ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：用于多节点通信的网络接口配置。将 `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（通过 `ifconfig` 获取），并将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。每个节点都必须正确配置这些参数，才能实现成功的多节点通信。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 2 --data-parallel-size-local 1`：在两个节点上运行两个 DP rank，每个节点一个 rank；每个 rank 在其节点内使用 TP8。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`：当前节点的起始 DP rank 偏移量。节点 0 使用 `0`，节点 1 使用 `1`。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 一致。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12321`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。所有节点必须相同。\n"
"- `--headless`：表示非主节点（在节点 1 上使用）。不要在节点 0 上使用。"

